        "value": {
          "amount": 1826.85,
          "currency": "RON",
          "year": 2022
        }
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "The last gap in the A1 between Boița and Nădlac. The contract covers just over 13 km: the 4.03 km of Section D left unfinished east of Margina and the 9.13 km of Section E with the twin-bore bear tunnels, 2.13 km in total (DRDP Timișoara figures, January 2023). CNAIR and most reports quote only the 9.13 km. The start order for design was issued on 5 December 2022; tunnel excavation began at the start of 2025 and both bores of Tunnel 2 (1,985 m and 1,825 m) were through by 18 September 2026, with physical progress past 75%. CNAIR's director general expects traffic in the first half of 2027"
      },
